General Sans is served from this site rather than from a font CDN, so no
cross-origin round trip sits on the critical rendering path.

General Sans is designed by Indian Type Foundry and distributed on Fontshare
for personal and commercial use.

  General Sans — https://www.fontshare.com/fonts/general-sans

Scripts the file does not cover (Arabic, Hebrew, Devanagari, CJK, and others)
fall through to the system font named after it in the stack.
